  "post_content": "<p>(12 fotos) La vesprada d&#39;aquest dijous ha comen&ccedil;at el curs 2017-18 de l&#39;Escola Municipal de Teatre (EMT) a Onda, amb sengles reunions.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/EMTonda2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La pimera amb alumnat de prim&agrave;ria i secund&agrave;ria, i pares mares.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/EMTonda3.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La segona, per a l&#39;alumnat dels tres cursos generals.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/11/EMTonda1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>S&#39;han celebrat a La Cassola amb la pres&egrave;ncia del tinent d&#39;alcaldia de Cultura, Llu&iacute;s Pastor Catalan, el director de l&#39;EMT, Eduard Costa Gonzalvo, i un dels professors.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7272.jpg\" alt=\"img_7272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7281.jpg\" alt=\"img_7281\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7282.jpg\" alt=\"img_7282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7287.jpg\" alt=\"img_7287\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7289.jpg\" alt=\"img_7289\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7291.jpg\" alt=\"img_7291\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7294.jpg\" alt=\"img_7294\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7298.jpg\" alt=\"img_7298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7303.jpg\" alt=\"img_7303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7306.jpg\" alt=\"img_7306\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7307.jpg\" alt=\"img_7307\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/reunionsescolesteatremunicipal/img_7310.jpg\" alt=\"img_7310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
